    "statement": "Every complete negative (4,3,3) two-loop packet has no outside antipodal I-I edge. Its two colored I-J orbits attach to distinct I antipodal pairs, and its five internal I-I orbit multiplicities are uniquely (1,2,2). Thus, up to pair labels, the outside types are B-D,C-E,D-E,both D-F signs,both E-F signs; one internal signed type occupies eta and the other six records occupy L complement.",
